5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I will rely on logical deduction and verify identities through observation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"I’m here to have fun, but I’ll keep my eyes sharp for liars.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,This looks like a huge adventure! I want to find the bad guys fast!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,I will focus on factual consistency and stability in our group dynamics.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I observe patterns. Emotions are noise. Logic is the only signal that matters.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. We must distinguish between genuine fear and performative panic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! If someone is too calm, they might be hiding something, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think the werewolf will try to blend in with the nice people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,Calmness is not deception. I value composure. We need to track behavioral shifts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,@Minako Correct. A sudden change in tone is a stronger indicator than baseline calm.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,@Shion I concur. We should document every statement for later cross-referencing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"That sounds like a lot of work, but I’m up for it! Let’s stay sharp.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I’ll try to remember everything, but I might forget small details.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,I will keep a mental log. Consistency is key to identifying the impostor.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Memory is fallible. I rely on structural analysis of the conversation flow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Let us proceed with caution. The first night will provide the first data point.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,May,,I’m ready! Let’s see who survives the night. Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,I hope we catch the werewolf before they catch us!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Minako,,We will maintain order. Panic leads to error. Stay focused.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,The game begins. I will watch.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
